    <!-- Localization infrastructure. This is the only populated
         locale today; existing hardcoded UI strings are NOT being retrofitted (out of scope by
         explicit decision), but any *new* UI text should be added here and referenced via
         {DynamicResource} in XAML or AppLocalization.Get(...) in code-behind, never hardcoded.

         Key convention: "Str.<Area>.<Purpose>". "Str.Dialog.*" holds strings shared across every
         small modal (Cancel/Save/etc.) so dialogs reuse one key instead of each defining its own
         copy of "Cancel". -->

